{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2L0Fsb25lJTIwSW4lMjBCZXJsaW4lMjAlMjgyMDE2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Alone In Berlin","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8BuRgEY3dMw8usxelybUS1K3NMd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qx9r2keMWhYZgnncVR9DiNvfFnI.jpg","description":"Berlin in June of 1940. While Nazi propaganda celebrates the regime’s victory over France, a kitchen-cum-living room in Prenzlauer Berg is filled with grief. Anna and Otto Quangel’s son has been killed at the front. This working class couple had long believed in the ‘Führer’ and followed him willingly, but now they realise that his promises are nothing but lies and deceit. They begin writing postcards as a form of resistance and in a bid to raise awareness: Stop the war machine! Kill Hitler! Putting their lives at risk, they distribute these cards in the entrances of tenement buildings and in stairwells. But the SS and the Gestapo are soon onto them, and even their neighbours pose a threat.\n\nRated R · Released 15 Feb 2016 · France, Germany · Language: English · 103 min\nStudio: X Filme Creative Pool, Master Movies, FilmWave\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["War","Thriller","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.7","imdb_id":"tt3026488","moviedb_id":334522,"tmdbId":334522,"runtime":"103 min","cast":["Emma Thompson","Brendan Gleeson","Daniel Brühl","Mikael Persbrandt","Katharina Schüttler","Louis Hofmann","Rafael Gareisen","Hildegard Schroedter"],"director":["Vincent Perez"],"writer":["Achim von Borries","Hans Fallada"],"released":"2016-02-15T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The truth was their resistance.","country":"France, Germany, United Kingdom","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Vincent Perez","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mpNv77WJ0kmi8vecBmRKQAdRzzo.jpg"},{"name":"Emma Thompson","character":"Anna Quangel","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zQ0